# ── Agent workflow files (local-only, never tracked) ──────────
# Project-level Claude instructions are private working notes.
/CLAUDE.md
# Session status tracker for the coding agent.
/workflow_status.md
# Rotated history of the session status tracker.
/workflow_status_archive.md
# Local design/plan notes for the coding agent.
docs/superpowers/

# ── Snowflake credentials ─────────────────────────────────────
# Real connection files with account/user details.
**/connection.toml
# Private keys for key-pair auth.
*.pem
# Any local environment-variable file holding secrets.
.env
# Any SQL script filled in with a real secret/PAT value.
*.local.sql

# ── Grader / worksheet exports (can carry account PII) ────────
# Snowsight's default export filenames for ad hoc worksheet results.
**/Untitled*.csv
**/scratchpad*.csv
# Auto-grader result exports carry real account email and login name.
**/Autograder_Result*.csv
# Ad hoc SHOW/SELECT diagnostic output.
**/schema-check.csv

# ── Lab working files ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Local unzip of dynamic-tables.zip (the zip itself is tracked).
coco-foundations/assets/dynamic-tables/

# ── Python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Compiled bytecode cache.
__pycache__/
# Compiled Python files.
*.pyc
# Local virtual environments.
.venv/
venv/

# ── OS / editor ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# macOS Finder metadata.
.DS_Store
# Windows Explorer thumbnail cache.
Thumbs.db
# Editor-local settings.
.vscode/
.idea/
